    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "'And so Kereseira, the singer of epics, the gentlest hero of Agamem, hung her harp upon the branches of the laurel tree\u2014'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "'Its body made from the tallest firs atop Mount Hymnoi, its strings made from the bravest burdenbeast that roamed the Agnes Plains;'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "'When it played, all things in the Land of Heroes sang together, riding upon the winds in freedom.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "No wonder you came up with the idea of holding the exchange ceremony on the temple square when you saw the completed statue of Kereseira."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "You brought Kereseira's true harp, the one that used to be displayed in the First Temple of Old Athenius?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Yes!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Legend has it that Kereseira was inspired to carve a massive harp from mountain rocks and firs after hearing the mountains tell their stories beneath Mt. Hymnoi."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "It was a blessed harp that only sang on important occasions, or when played by a great hero like Kereseira, offering a song that touches the people's hearts."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "The First Temple was destroyed when the Sargonians invaded Old Athenius."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "Grieving the tragedy, the harp sang no more, and afterwards went missing."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Until Padishah Khery found it in his collection."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "I don't know how it ended up in Sargon\u2014perhaps a Sargonian soldier looted it from Old Athenius and sold it to the padishah's ancestor."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "I don't think anyone alive in Athenius has ever seen the original harp."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "The only people who would know anything about the harp are a few priests well-versed with ancient texts, or oribenders like Kassandra who directly communicate with the heroes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "Does it still make a sound?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "We performed an inspection on the strings. They're a little aged, but still in playing condition."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "I see. Perhaps the silence of the harp was simply a metaphor, as is often the case in Minoan stories..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
