    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Well, we entered Athenius by the ancient route, which is pretty rough. We couldn't risk any damage to the relic."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "I had the museum staff prepare a packaging that's fireproof, waterproof, shockproof, and impact-proof, which unfortunately added a ton of weight to it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "On the other hand, it wouldn't get a scratch on it, even if an earthquake suddenly shook a whole house down onto it!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "I can see you take great care of your museum and collection."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "I went to Columbia to study museology because I was curious about everything, and ended up working in a museum when I went back to Sargon."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "But my father died young, and my family's a far cry from its past glory... honestly, I'm not sure why the padishah picked me to lead the diplomatic mission..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "But it's my job now, and I want to do it right!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "Did I ever tell you that you\u2014"
