    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lamenting Male Voice",
        "text": "What kind of a ferryman are you?! Full sails from five meters away? On a windy day like this? You knew your boat would go even faster than Hermes the Messenger!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Calm Male Voice",
        "text": "You wanted the boat as close to the kitchen as possible."
